                            Security Check v1.0
                            -------------------

 Security Check (fno called SC) ask's the user for the four (4) last
 digit's if his/her voice phonenr. If the person can't answer that question
 properly, SC will automaticly drop the carrier. A quite easy and good
 way to protect your board from hacking. you install SC by adding the
 following line to your sys.welcome file, located in SYSTEXT:

   #0 Pfiles:Sec.REXX}
   ^
   |
  This is a <CTRL+Q>

 And edit the line in the .REXX file saying :

  Cchance = xx

 Where xx should be a digit between 0 and 99, which is the chance in %
 that SecCheck will go into action.

 Well, I guess that's about all.....

